// Biology launcher activation sentinel.
//
// Cyberpunk/REDmod 2.31 defines IconicWeaponModAbilityBase in package Items.
// The shipped base file declares `package Items` first and then defines the base
// unqualified inside that package. Biology mirrors that same-package source shape
// instead of using the standalone top-level `using Items` form rejected by the
// attended REDmod 2.31 parser.
//
// The declaration is additive and intentionally inert: no gameplay record points
// at BiologyLauncherActivationMarker. Loose Biology REDscript reads only the
// inherited stackable flat as the non-persistent REDmod-owned launcher authority.
// REDlauncher Enable mods OFF therefore makes
// Items.BiologyLauncherActivationMarker.stackable resolve to the supplied default
// false rather than allowing loose redscript/framework state to keep Biology active.
package Items

BiologyLauncherActivationMarker : IconicWeaponModAbilityBase
{
    stackable = true;
}
